243
00:18:03,710 --> 00:18:08,270
It then pulls in the email because it has to summarize that email.

244
00:18:08,270 --> 00:18:12,830
and in the act of processing that email, it processes the malicious instructions,

245
00:18:12,830 --> 00:18:16,910
which basically tells the Copilot to go and do other things. And in this case of Echo leak,

246
00:18:16,910 --> 00:18:23,190
it was all about extracting more sensitive information and exfiltrating it to the attacker control server.

247
00:18:23,190 --> 00:18:25,310
and further instructing the LLM to not even mention.

248
00:18:25,320 --> 00:18:31,110
that this was said in the email back to the user when summarizing the email.

249
00:18:31,110 --> 00:18:37,190
So, it's a rather complicated but a very simple attack.

250
00:18:37,190 --> 00:18:44,830
that exploits the inability of the LLMs to distinguish between system instructions and user instructions.

251
00:18:44,830 --> 00:18:48,310
and tokens coming in from the context,

252
00:18:48,310 --> 00:18:52,550
and you know, adhering to what has been said in the sum total of all of these tokens.

253
00:18:52,550 --> 00:18:55,630
collected from various sources.

