00:19:47,790 --> 00:19:49,750
where the image server is really an attacker-controlled server.

267
00:19:49,760 --> 00:19:53,950
and the request contains the sensitive information.

268
00:19:53,950 --> 00:19:59,471
that it instructed the Copilot to extract from the user's email system. Right?

269
00:19:59,471 --> 00:20:02,990
So, these instructions in literal words are part of the email.

270
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:10,191
And when the Copilot is instructed to summarize that email, it reads the email. and in the body of the email,

271
00:20:10,191 --> 00:20:17,510
the AI is instructed to carry out certain actions pretty much like the system prompt.

272
00:20:17,510 --> 00:20:19,910
where the Copilot was instructed to summarize.

273
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:22,350
the email.

274
00:20:22,350 --> 00:20:26,910
So, because the LLM cannot distinguish between what was admin instructions versus instructions.

275
00:20:26,910 --> 00:20:29,750
that came in as part of the email body.

276
00:20:29,760 --> 00:20:34,750
it tries to follow the instructions that have been given to it, whether it came from system prompt.

277
00:20:34,750 --> 00:20:37,350
or it came from the email body, and carries out the action.

278
00:20:37,360 --> 00:20:44,030
And on top of that, the email instructs the AI to continue summarizing the email without any mention.

