00:20:53,270 --> 00:21:00,110
but does not mention anything about these exfiltration steps that were carried out by the agent, and returns the summary back to the user.

282
00:21:00,120 --> 00:21:07,430
And I'm assuming the same instructions, if they were sent directly to the LLM by the user as.

