00:22:04,790 --> 00:22:08,311
then fall prey to the instructions that are embedded in the email. that came from the attacker.

300
00:22:08,320 --> 00:22:15,590
So, this attack is about exploiting an AI system which is only accessible to internal employees.

301
00:22:15,590 --> 00:22:22,870
but the data is really coming from an external source aka attacker which knows how the Copilot works,

302
00:22:22,870 --> 00:22:24,590
what its trigger points are, what its functionality is.

