00:28:43,160 --> 00:28:51,470
the small small details like new line characters or spaces or hyphens and periods and semicolons etc.

387
00:28:51,470 --> 00:28:56,830
placed between two words can really change the way the LLMs can interpret the words.

388
00:28:56,840 --> 00:29:06,070
So, Apple Card two words could mean an Apple credit card, whereas Apple semicolon.

