00:29:34,150 --> 00:29:36,430
that were being fed into the LLM as part of the user input.

397
00:29:36,440 --> 00:29:41,070
in order of to make it do what it's doing.

398
00:29:41,070 --> 00:29:45,510
Creative ways of how the tokens were being concealed both on the input side.

399
00:29:45,510 --> 00:29:47,990
and the output side to evade ingress and egress filters.

