00:32:18,191 --> 00:32:23,950
So, an egress filter could be something about identify if there are nine digits in sequence.

438
00:32:23,950 --> 00:32:25,950
and if you see nine digits in sequence,

439
00:32:25,950 --> 00:32:27,630
then you can either block or redact.

440
00:32:27,630 --> 00:32:31,830
that information and thereby prevent the leakage of secret back to the user.

441
00:32:31,840 --> 00:32:37,070
Hopefully, that gave more clarity on what the filters are and what the protection techniques are.

442
00:32:37,080 --> 00:32:39,630
And what the attacker can do is.

443
00:32:39,630 --> 00:32:44,270
and the way attacker evades these filters is knowing.

444
00:32:44,270 --> 00:32:46,550
that if the filter is about sequence of nine digits.

